property: data variables type <ME:0000293> = Chemical Measurement <DA:0000005>
property: comment <ME:0000011> = Sediment core taken during the installation of well FW-305 (Oak Ridge FRC, Background A; well completed 2013-05-29), 54 sections from 0.5 to 26.08 ft below ground surface. Measured by the Elias Lab (ORNL); workbook by Kathryn Bailey, 2013-08-02
property: comment <ME:0000011> = Anions and organic acids by ion chromatography, micromolar as given in the workbook. Iron(2+) and iron(3+) are mg of iron per g of soil. Moisture content is percent
property: comment <ME:0000011> = Where the workbook leaves an anion or organic acid cell empty, the analyte was not detected in that section: the concentration is blank and the below variable of that analyte is true. The workbook gives no detection limits; every section has values from the same ion chromatography run. Butyrate and citrate were not detected in any section. Formate of FW305-01-36 is blank with below false: the workbook has 6969, a typing error with no recoverable value (all other formate values are 0.03 to 6.95)
property: comment <ME:0000011> = Source: ENIGMA Google Drive, IC Analysis of Core.xlsx. The workbook's injection number (order of the instrument runs) is not stored
dim: environmental sample <ME:0000100>
dim_var: environmental sample ID <ME:0000102>
dim_size: 54
